OL,3,GNEWSABonfire Night violence: We can't
OL,4,Aaccept this as normal, says Police
OL,5,AFederation
OL,6,
OL,7,FDeploying 1,700 police officers on the
OL,8,Fstreets to deal with Bonfire Night
OL,9,Fviolence cannot be accepted as normal,
OL,10,Fthe Scottish Police Federation has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FSeven people were arrested and a police
OL,14,Fvan set alight in violent flashpoints
OL,15,Fduring what was Scotland's biggest
OL,16,Fpolice operation since the visit of
OL,17,FPresident Donald Trump last year.
