OL,3,GNEWSABonfire Night violence: We can't
OL,4,Aaccept this as normal, says Police
OL,5,AFederation
OL,6,
OL,7,FA police officer and an ambulance staff
OL,8,Fmember were injured when they were
OL,9,Fattacked with fireworks while
OL,10,Fresponding to a report of an injured
OL,11,Fman in Glasgow.
OL,13,FThe body which represents rank and file
OL,14,Fofficers has now called for tougher
OL,15,Fstop-and-search laws and a crackdown on
OL,16,Fyouth crime to tackle what has become
OL,17,Fan annual night of trouble.
